    "id": "113-Q057",
    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "57.  下列化療或標靶藥物可能造成interstitial lung disease (ILD) or pneumonitis，何者為**非**？ \n        (A) Trastuzumab deruxtecan  \n        (B) Pembrolizumab  \n        (C) Abemaciclib \n        (D) Trastuzumab emtansine (TDM1) \n        (E) Bleomycin \n\n解答: D\n\n說明:\n(A) Trastuzumab deruxtecan 造成 Interstitial lung disease 為 13.6%\n(B) Pembrolizumab 造成  Pneumonitis 為 5.8%\n(C) Abemaciclib 造成 Pneumonitis 為 2.7%, placebo 為 1.3%\n(D) Trastuzumab emtansine (TDM1) 無 lung fibrosis 毒性, 其他嚴重副作用為liver toxicity, decrease LVEF \n(E) Bleomycin 是長期已知的lung fibrosis危險因子,發生率接近10%\n\n\n參考:\n(A) Trastuzumab Deruxtecan in Previously Treated HER2-Positive Breast Cancer\n    https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1914510\n\n(B) Pembrolizumab versus Chemotherapy for PD-L1–Positive Non–Small-Cell Lung Cancer\n    https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1606774\n\n(C) Abemaciclib Combined With Endocrine Therapy for the Adjuvant Treatment of HR+, HER2−, Node-Positive, High-Risk, Early Breast Cancer (monarchE)\n    https://ascopubs.org/doi/10.1200/JCO.20.02514?url_ver=Z39.88-2003&rfr_id=ori:rid:crossref.org&rfr_dat=cr_pub%20%200pubmed\n\n(D) Overview and Management of Drug-Induced Interstitial Lung Disease With Novel Treatments in HER2+ Breast Cancer, Lung Cancers, and Gastrointestinal Cancers\n    https://www.onclive.com/view/overview-and-management-of-drug-induced-interstitial-lung-disease-with-novel-treatments-in-her2\n\n(E) Bleomycin-Induced Lung Injury\n    https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1155/2013/480608",
    "questionTextFromExplanationFile": "下列化療或標靶藥物可能造成interstitial lung disease (ILD) or pneumonitis，何者為**非**？",
