    "explanation": "58.  健保署在2024年7月已經開放NGS檢測，針對肺癌，下列何者**非**ESMO Scale for Clinical Actionability of molecular Targets (ESCAT) evidence tier I marker及其對應藥物(ready for routine use)？ \n        (A) BRAF V600E: Dabrafenib plus trametinib \n        (B) MET exon 14 skipping mutation: Capmatinib \n        (C) gPALB2 mutation: Talazoparib \n        (D) ALK translocation: Crizotinib \n        (E) EGFR exon 20 insertion mutation: Amivantamab\n\n解答: C\n\n詳解:\n(A) BRAF V600E: Dabrafenib plus trametinib : Capmatinib ESCAT 為 IB 級 (2023 ESMO NSCLC)\n(B) MET exon 14 skipping mutation: Capmatinib ESCAT 為 IB 級 (2023 ESMO NSCLC)\n(C) gPALB2 mutation: Talazoparib 不在2023 ESMO NSCLC名單上,在 2020 ESCAT為 IIIA 級\n(D) ALK translocation: Crizotinib ESCAT 為 IB 級 (2023 ESMO NSCLC)\n(E) EGFR exon 20 insertion mutation: Amivantamab ESCAT 為 IB 級 (2023 ESMO NSCLC)\n\n參考:\nRecommendations for the use of next-generation sequencing (NGS) for patients with metastatic cancers: a report from the ESMO Precision Medicine Working Group\nhttps://www.annalsofoncology.org/article/S0923-7534(20)39971-3/fulltext\n\nOncogene-addicted metastatic non-small-cell lung cancer: ESMO Clinical Practice Guideline for diagnosis, treatment and follow-up\nhttps://www.annalsofoncology.org/article/S0923-7534(22)04781-0/fulltext",
